        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-28T15:37:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can’t get over the classic comic idea that the first time Tachyon and Unity met one of them threw their arms around the other and kissed their partner, confusion reins and the one says “Oops! Wrong time period” and jumps on to the future/present day for them. Then the first time they met ‘for reals’ the kissed becomes the kissie and they can both claim<br>\n“The first time we met, she kissed me, we hadn’t even been introduced”</p>\n<p>(you know, because a tech wizard and someone who breaks the lightspeed barrier can both time travel if they put their mind to it!)</p>",
