        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Ryushikaze&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Ryushikaze\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ironically, this is going to affect a friend’s fanfic villain whose main motivation is to pair up the heroes with each other- by any means necessary.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Prepare… for a match made in HELL!!</p>\n<p>Or more Eugeneticly motivated? Some kind of creepy organisation that tries to make specific heroes fall in love with each other (endangering many bystanders in the process) as to create THE ULTIMATE HERO BABY (OK, I stole this from the plot of a certain rhythm game).</p>",
        "post_number": 29,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:55:16.971Z",
