        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-11T13:40:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No no, nothing so forward thinking, just an insane rabid fangirl with superpowers to back up the madness. I won’t go into more detail than that, though. All the crazy pairings are slash and/or massively out of character, which is part of the point.</p>\n<p>I won’t say any more about the character here though, since I think it would run afoul of the no talking about hero concepts rules.</p>",
